, "tags": [], "warranty": "{\"BenefitCopy\":[{\"Feature\":\"Customize your cooking\",\"Copy\":\"Create meals that reflect your personal style with a single oven that can be used in five different ways. The advanced cooking technologies include a Convection Oven, Microwave, Toaster Oven, Warming/Proofing Oven, and Speed Cook Oven with Advantium Technology\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--d-m2alY7--/3ffef0c1691137058ecc09a12661cca74154ba40.jpg\",\"Video\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Sme0hg_wRvQ\"},{\"Feature\":\"Speed cooking with oven quality results\",\"Copy\":\"Achieve delicious oven-quality results two to four times faster than a conventional oven with a blend true European convection heat, microwave and the energy from light that balances the heat type and source to give amazing results in a fraction of the time.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--HgxDtIOS--/d33f84cfc59e26780c70c5609d0f09215f23ffcd.jpg\",\"Video\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wSq63mcAFWI\"},{\"Feature\":\"An LCD display with a touch of style\",\"Copy\":\"Easily navigate wall oven settings with the beautiful full color display that adds a unique element of style to your kitchen\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--pSMEobPN--/6d4c0f3ef34c1f717cc15e5d322b6d8eda1832a3.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"Bring the flavor with steam\",\"Copy\":\"Use the steam option to cook a variety of proteins such as fish, chicken and pork, vegetables and grains such as rice, pasta and quinoa. The steam option creates a moist cooking environment, keeping foods juicy and full of flavor\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--khf2_Hwe--/c63863737c223c23fd436e046604fa76df3b93b7.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"No pre-heat required\",\"Copy\":\"Your dishes begin to cook immediately because the Five in One Oven with 120V Advantium® Technology needs no pre-heat time and cooks two to four times faster than a conventional oven\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--1Z73bz_U--/992e9df23435cdf67e0ff5ddb7102b469a60f550.jpg\",\"Video\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/W0YBsykRDXQ\"},{\"Feature\":\"Perfectly reheated food\",\"Copy\":\"You get crispy results at microwave speed with 20+ reheat programs for leftovers that taste like first time to table\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--iLhV1-Np--/ff6240f86abaab692240cc59ca79a65ec6b74ee2.jpg\",\"Video\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_9Zx7AYU26Y\"},{\"Feature\":\"Create a look that matches your personal style\",\"Copy\":\"Select any combination of premium finishes and hardware options to create a stunning look customized to any owner’s taste\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--Ru2omtcF--/85e97048722fae584f59ddeb576c31e6a4cdcf98.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"Check cooking progress - from anywhere!\",\"Copy\":\"You don't have to open the oven door to see how your dish is coming along thanks to the in-oven camera - this tool provides an interior view of cooking food right from your smartphone, even outside of the kitchen!\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--4QdNyjfp--/667327e89793ea8d00da2fd25174239494555e9e.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"The perfect fit you’ve always dreamed of\",\"Copy\":\"When you’re updating your kitchen, attention to detail is a priority. That’s why CAFÉ™ Advantium wall ovens are guaranteed for an exact fit for an easy and seamless replacement.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--g4teJO7_--/6e95a9bf1c1ccbcd9ef54f8e856796abf7a5e081.jpg\"}], \"variants\":[],\"Value_Prop\":\"The CAFÉ™ 27” Five in One Advantium oven is THE tool that offers five cooking technologies in one oven! Customize your cooking with speed cook, toast, broil, warming/proofing, microwave plus over-the-air updates and an in-oven camera that will make you shine in the kitchen like never before. Take your culinary repertoire to the next level with one oven that does it all!\"}", "price": {"without_tax": {"format